Package: noaaworries
Title: Local Parquet Archive and Tools for NOAA Coral Reef Watch 5 km Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kevin", "Novak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "kbairosnovak@gmail.com")
Description: Builds and reads a compact local parquet archive of NOAA Coral
    Reef Watch 5 km products (CoralTemp sea surface temperature, degree
    heating weeks and related summaries). Downloading and conversion are done
    by a bundled Python script; reading, point extraction and heat stress
    calculations are done in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: arrow, dplyr, jsonlite, tibble
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.8) with numpy, netCDF4 and pyarrow (archive building only)
